WHY GPLv3
================================================================================

The application incorporates the Meshtastic protobuf definitions vendored under
app/src/main/proto/meshtastic/, which are licensed GPL-3.0. Because those
definitions are compiled into the shipped binary, the application as a whole is
distributed under GPL-3.0. A permissive licence is not available for this
project without replacing or re-deriving those definitions and re-verifying
every dependency below.

Earlier revisions of README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md stated Apache-2.0. That was
an error introduced when the README was edited without changing LICENSE; it has
been corrected. No relicensing was ever performed or intended.

